  "description": "The Process 134 CR DL is the Beauty and the Beast of our lineup. It’s sleek, cable-free lines and killer top-of-the-line spec will turn heads all season long. Meanwhile the 134mm of rear travel descends like nothing you’ve ever experienced on a mid-travel trail bike. This bike is our secret weapon. It climbs lightning fast and rips downhills like hungry cougar chasing an ill-fated deer. Sorry, deer. Your time is up.\n\n“The good suspension balance adds confidence and responsiveness when tackling fast consecutive turns. Get into rougher terrain and you soon forget this little bike only has 134mm of travel as it hammers through the chunder, muting smaller bumps impressively.” -Mountain Bike UK",
